starts today...

00:02:56.608 --> 00:02:58.911
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:58.911 --> 00:03:01.981
...and people take this sale
very seriously.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:03.650
This morning,
there was a 30-minute wait

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.385
to even get on the website.

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:07.053
-Ooh.
-It is so popular that,
this year,

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:09.588
