00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:15.028
18 scented Bath &amp; Body Works
candles, max.

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:15.762
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.762 --> 00:03:17.830
-Well?

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.265
-Well, what?

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:21.901
-Well, what 18 Bath &amp; Body Works
candles are you going to buy?

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.202
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:25.204
-That's easy.
It's a no-brainer.

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:27.506
Winter Candy Apple,
Mahogany Balsam,

00:03:27.506 --> 00:03:30.276
Mahogany Teakwood, Holiday,
Hot Cocoa &amp; Cream,

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.378
Sugared Snickerdoodle,
Snowflakes &amp; Citrus,

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:35.147
Flannel, Fresh Balsam,
Peppermint Sugar Cookie,

00:03:35.147 --> 00:03:37.383
Champagne Toast,
Marshmallow Fireside,

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:39.185
